added:        2026-10-10 by grib_job
notes:        Original clean-room English-to-Russian translation of the full 3,592-string
              reference catalog, using ordinary Russian video-editing vocabulary (Premiere-style
              terms: последовательность, корзина, дорожка, визуализация). No proprietary
              localisation resource, string table or product interface was consulted. Drafted
              with the project's agents and reviewed against the tests; native-speaker review
              still welcome.
